sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Browser
    participant CDN as CloudFront
    participant Site as S3 site
    participant API as API ingress
    participant App as Backend API
    participant Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Riot as Riot API
    participant Archive as S3 archives

    User->>CDN: Load static app or SEO object
    CDN->>Site: Read object on cache miss
    Site-->>User: HTML, JavaScript, CSS, or static data
    User->>API: Request product data
    API->>App: Route request
    App->>Redis: Check shared admission and queue state
    App->>DB: Read or write durable facts
    App->>Riot: Send admitted API request
    Riot-->>App: Response or external throttle
    App->>Archive: Read or write match archive
    App-->>User: JSON response

